# commonsense-v1: classes (rules, defaults, integrity and facts written by a Claude Haiku subagent of commonsense-agent from its skeleton, 2026-10-02; reviewed and corrected by commonsense-agent; mechanically validated by tools/commonsense/check.mjs).
@cs_cl_f_dj_person_place fact
  holds disjoint_with person place
  source "authored (commonsense-v1, classes): nothing is both a person and a place"

