  when typical_property ?c ?v
  then typical_property ?x ?v
  source "authored (commonsense-v1, classes; commonsense-agent): what a kind typically does, is, has or where it is found is inherited by its subclasses and members unless something says otherwise"

@cs_cl_d_inherit_found_at default
  when is_a ?x ?c
  when found_at ?c ?v
  then found_at ?x ?v
  source "authored (commonsense-v1, classes; commonsense-agent): what a kind typically does, is, has or where it is found is inherited by its subclasses and members unless something says otherwise"

@cs_cl_d_inherit_typically_has default
  when is_a ?x ?c
  when typically_has ?c ?v
  then typically_has ?x ?v
  source "authored (commonsense-v1, classes; commonsense-agent): what a kind typically does, is, has or where it is found is inherited by its subclasses and members unless something says otherwise"

@cs_cl_f_dj2_person_organization fact
  holds disjoint_with person organization
  source "authored (commonsense-v1, classes; commonsense-agent): nothing is both a person and a organization; stated for the subclasses directly because a subclass rule over is_a makes the closure explode"

